<p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> September 15, 2026
<p>Welcome to Promotioins CRM ("we," "our," or "us"). This short privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you visit our website.</p>
<p><strong>1. Information</strong></p>
<p>We CollectInformation you give us: When you fill out a contact form or subscribe to a newsletter, we may collect your name and email address.Information collected automatically: When you browse our site, our servers automatically log technical data like your IP address, browser type, and basic usage details through cookies.</p>
<p><strong>2. How We Use Your Information</strong></p>
<p>We use the information we collect to:Operate and improve our website.Respond to your messages or send requested newsletters.Understand how visitors use our content.</p>
<p><strong>3. Sharing Your Information</strong></p>
<p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal data to others. We only share data with trusted third-party tools (like hosting providers or analytics services) that help us run our website.</p>
<p><strong>4. Cookies</strong></p>
<p>We use cookies (small files placed on your device) to help the website work properly and analyze traffic. You can turn off cookies in your browser settings.</p>
<p><strong>5. Your Rights</strong></p>
<p>You can ask to see, update, or delete any personal data we hold about you. To do so, please contact us.</p>
<p><strong>6. Contact Us</strong></p>
<p>If you have questions about this policy, please email us at: [Your Email Address].If you'd like, let me know:What type of website you have (e-commerce, blog, portfolio)If you collect payments or use tracking pixels/ads</p>
